        "en": "Friendly and attentive salon groomers"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently praise the salon team for their courteous customer service and gentle handling. Pet owners regularly name individual stylists such as Starla, Jayla, and Christian for their accommodating nature and technical talent. Reviewers appreciate that groomers take time to understand styling preferences and build trust with companion dogs."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Precision haircuts and coat conditioning"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners commend the quality of haircuts, scissor blending, deshedding treatments, and paw conditioning. Reviewers note that double-coated breeds and doodles come away looking impeccably tidy, smelling fresh, and shedding substantially less at home. Multiple clients praise stylists for correcting previous poor trims from other salons."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle reassurance for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The salon is praised for creating a calm atmosphere that puts nervous and fearful dogs at ease during grooming sessions. Reviewers note that stylists handle companion animals with immense patience, soothing anxious puppies and larger breeds throughout bathing and trimming. Owners feel confident that pets are treated with genuine kindness."
      }
    }
